  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups white sugar",
    "1 cup butter",
    "2 large eggs",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.66666668653488 cup unsweetened cocoa powder",
    "0.75 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "2 cups peanut butter chips"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease 2 cookie sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qXlFoZvRD0NHg0Q4nu0yj3QeKII=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15469-peanut-butter-chip-chocolate-cookies-ddmfs-4x3-step-01-1485-95f27f5725ce490b883d7419bb0c21ab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15469/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat sugar and butter with an electric mixer in a large bowl until smooth and fluffy. Beat first egg into butter mixture. Beat in second egg along with vanilla extract.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mL_GQCv8xIDMveXALfC8d4gTR-8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15469-peanut-butter-chip-chocolate-cookies-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-1489-765bed5121444fba87986ad085038c48.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15469/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, cocoa, baking soda, and salt in a separate bowl; stir into creamed mixture until just combined. Fold in peanut butter chips. Drop cookies by heaping teaspoonfuls onto the prepared cookie sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/V2FAh3pZGaLQX1uKpQNso_JssP0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15469-peanut-butter-chip-chocolate-cookies-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-1492-d860bdbe0e1041a0966297169fa7957f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15469/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until edges are set, 8 to 10 minutes. Cool on the baking sheets briefly before removing to a wire rack to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eq3adt6objdc7puNCqlk3BPi7FQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15469-peanut-butter-chip-chocolate-cookies-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-1495-061c14ea22b347d59cfe5cc965651b6e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15469/step_04.webp"
    }
  ],
